[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/comments/4143988206","html_url":"https://github.com/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/510#issuecomment-4143988206","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/510","id":4143988206,"node_id":"IC_kwDOETHxjc73AD3u","user":{"login":"crazy-max","id":1951866,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NTE4NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1951866?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max","html_url":"https://github.com/crazy-max","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T16:58:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T16:58:41Z","body":"This looks like the same class of problem as the retry requests already discussed in sibling actions, for example:\n\n* docker/login-action#750\n* docker/login-action#885\n* docker/login-action#862\n* docker/build-push-action#719\n* docker/build-push-action#1241\n\nIn this case the failure happens while the Docker daemon is pulling the BuildKit image during builder bootstrap:\n\n```\nHead \"https://registry-1.docker.io/v2/moby/buildkit/manifests/buildx-stable-1\": toomanyrequests\n```\n\nI don't think adding retry logic in `setup-buildx-action` is the right direction.\n\nThis is not really a Buildx setup feature, it's a generic workflow reliability problem. The same class of transient failures shows up across login, bootstrap, pulls, cache operations, auth, and pushes, depending on the runner, registry, and network path involved. Adding action-specific retry logic here would mean each action has to guess which errors are safe to retry across different registries and failure modes, which gets brittle quickly.\n\nIt's also the wrong abstraction layer. This kind of behavior belongs in GitHub runner/workflow primitives, for example first-class retry support for `uses:` steps, rather than each action inventing its own retry semantics. That would be reusable across actions, more consistent for users, and much more future proof.\n\nFor rate limiting specifically, action-local retries are not even obviously correct. Retrying from inside the action can just add more pressure and make the failure mode worse.\n\nSo I'd rather keep this tracked under the broader retry discussions above than add action-specific retry or backoff logic to this action.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/comments/4143988206/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/comments/4144558203","html_url":"https://github.com/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/510#issuecomment-4144558203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/510","id":4144558203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOETHxjc73CPB7","user":{"login":"steebchen","id":5013932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTM5MzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5013932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen","html_url":"https://github.com/steebchen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steebchen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T18:46:35Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T18:46:35Z","body":"Fair enough I guess","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/comments/4144558203/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/comments/4662829418","html_url":"https://github.com/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/510#issuecomment-4662829418","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/510","id":4662829418,"node_id":"IC_kwDOETHxjc8AAAABFe0hag","user":{"login":"beanscg","id":287763725,"node_id":"U_kgDOESbtDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287763725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg","html_url":"https://github.com/beanscg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beanscg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T18:33:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T18:33:01Z","body":"Bean Labs took a public-source pass on this issue.\n\nThe narrowest useful next step looks like: retry support boundary and current workaround\n\nPublic evidence checked:\n- README.md\n- action.yml\n- .github/workflows/\n\nA good acceptance check would be a docs diff that changes only the affected wording/link and renders without stale references.\n\nNo PR opened from this pass.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/comments/4662829418/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/comments/5679694255","html_url":"https://github.com/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/510#issuecomment-5679694255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/510","id":5679694255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOETHxjc8AAAABUolBrw","user":{"login":"crazy-max","id":1951866,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NTE4NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1951866?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max","html_url":"https://github.com/crazy-max","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crazy-max/orgs","repos_url":